  "description": "The HappyRun G70 Pro is the ultimate electric cargo bike for families. Equipped with a dual-motor system (front & rear, 2500W peak each, 5000W combined peak power), it delivers exceptional torque and climbing ability for any terrain. With dual batteries, two seats, and a robust frame, it’s perfect for carrying kids or cargo with ease. The rear seat can be swapped for a cargo rack, making it versatile for family rides, shopping, or commuting. Supporting up to 330 lbs, the G70 Pro offers unmatched power, flexibility, and reliability for everyday use and adventures..",
